@ Coin ring duration (code/sprites/time_controls.cpp): the Red Coin Ring's event switch,
@ 0x606C6DA8, replaced (its trampoline is never called). Entry: push {r11, lr}.

CoinRing_activate:
    type:       hook
    address:    0x006C6DA8
    symbol:     ModBase::levelTimer::ringActivate(StageActor*)
    trampoline: ModBase::levelTimer::ringActivate_orig(StageActor*)
